            "review_text": "Minh Tuan P\nDa Nang, Vietnam183 contributions\n0\ntasty dinner\nFeb 2019 • Family\nWe had dinner here twice. The overall feeling is really good\nThe restaurant was small and cozy with warm welcome of the staff. \nThe Sashimi is fresh. I like the cabbage salad here, simple and yet tasty. It bring our the water and the fresh of cabbage, goes perfectly well with the sesame oil and a pinch of salt. My favorite is the Ramen. Simple and clear broth base that perfectly highlighted the taste of sea clamp. Must try this dish.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten February 14, 2019",
